                <pb facs="0319" n="973" sameAs="frus:frus1875v02/pg973"/>

                <p>On the 27th of the same month of October the copy above provided for was
                    delivered to the citizen Toribio Lozano, and the present information was also
                    delivered to him. [A flourish.]</p>
                <p>The foregoing is a copy of the original now on file in this legation.</p>
                <closer><signed>JOSÉ T. DE CUELLAR,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Acting
                            Secretary</hi>.</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1875-01-28"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 28,
                        1875</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
